      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLEBOURKESTREET (5) has all the form on the board, and she seldom puts in a poor run, finishing runner-up as the favourite here nearly 3 weeks ago. She may have a query over the slightly longer trip, but still goes on top for us. RIVKIN (2) has mixed his form since relocating from NSW, and he will find this easier than his last start when finishing at the rear of the field. He is back down in class, and with the aid of a 2kg claim, he can bounce straight back into the money here. CONVINCEBILITY (1) has been close up in his last couple of starts, and was less than a length from the winner last time out at Kununurra nearly 4 weeks ago. Stick with him as a winning chance in this. BON'S YOUR BACK (4) has not won for some time, and dropping back to 1200m should be no issue. He is another top 3 hope in a small field. BRUNO BRUNO (3) has been improving in each of his 4 runs back from the spell, and with a drop in class, he can take this out.",
